error[L0515]: `bump!` changes its argument, but `change` passes it a copy
 --> check/changing_function_local.knv:5:17
  |
1 | (defn bump! (x) (set! x (+ x 1)))
  |                 ---------------- this would change only the copy
...
5 |   (local change bump!)
  |                 ^^^^^ this binding takes `bump!` as `(fn (i64) unit)`
  |
  = help: to change the caller's value, call `bump!` by name; to change a copy on purpose, start its body with `(local x x)`
